# Oengo API & Smart Contracts Rules
# MANDATORY FOR ALL AI AGENTS & DEVELOPERS

## Core Principles
1. ZERO-BUG & TEST PASSING MANDATE:
   - Always run `go test -v ./...` in `contracts/escrow` before any commit.
   - 100% of contract and API tests must pass with 0 errors.
   - Pushing unverified or failing code to `main` is strictly forbidden.

2. SECURITY & ESCROW PROTECTION:
   - Escrow states must mathematically preserve financial invariants.
   - Never commit private keys or environment secrets to git.
   - See `DEVELOPER_AND_AI_RULES.md` for complete enforcement policies.
